# Google Places API key — used at build time to fetch live Google reviews
# for the testimonials section on the home page.
#
# Get one at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   1. Create a project (or use an existing one)
#   2. Enable the "Places API (New)"
#   3. Create an API key, restrict it to "Places API (New)" for safety
#   4. Copy the key below and rename this file to `.env`
#
# Free tier covers ~17,000 requests/month — far more than build-time use needs.
# If unset, the site falls back to the curated testimonials in src/lib/reviews.ts.
PLACES_API_KEY=
